MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The HDMI cable and memory card with reader felt like useful next steps after my camcorder purchase because they support viewing, recording, and transferring footage, provided the connections and card are compatible.",
    "The Alexa-compatible smart plug fits my interest in convenient home controls alongside my Fire TV setup, with a specific use for controlling a lamp."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The internal SSDs assume I am upgrading a computer, while my recent purchases have focused on cameras and TV equipment. I have no current storage-upgrade project.",
    "The external drive has a possible video-backup use, but that is not an immediate need. The mouse and label tape lack a clear connection to what I am doing now, and I am not looking for extra outlets."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Buying electronics seems to have been treated as interest in general computer accessories, even though my current needs center on recording and watching video.",
    "My camera purchase seems to have prompted several storage-related suggestions, although recording footage does not mean I need internal drives or more backup space."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent camcorder and TV purchases create practical needs for compatible recording media, footage transfer, and playback connections.",
    "I choose accessories for a specific task: the card-and-reader bundle addresses my recording and transfer needs together, so I would not also choose the separate reader."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions partly understood my home video and connected-home interests but stretched them into computer upgrades and accessories I do not currently need."
}
